ok><name>JAPAN TOBACCO INC.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASHINO, SHIGEMI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AIZAWA TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MASHINO SHIGEMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AIZAWA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASHINO, SHIGEMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A cut cigarette feeding device of a cigarette producing machine, comprising two cigarette feeders (4) disposed along a cigarette band, each cigarette feeder further comprising reservoirs (12) and (13) for cut cigarette, a stacking chute (26) receiving cut cigarette through a bottom conveyor (18) and a lift conveyor (22) and stacking the cut cigarette, a feed roller unit (34) delivering the cut cigarette, an acceleration roller (43) accelerating the delivered cut cigarette, and a jet diffuser (46) blowing up the cut cigarette toward a chimney (10), the chimney being adjacent to the running direction of the cigarette band and inclined toward the running direction.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif d'alimentation de cigarettes coupées d'une machine de production de cigarettes, le dispositif comprenant deux chargeurs (4) de cigarettes placés le long d'une bande, chaque chargeur comprenant des réservoirs (12) et (13) de cigarettes coupées, une goulotte (26) réceptionnant et empilant les cigarettes coupées qui passent par un convoyeur (18) inférieur et un convoyeur (22) ascendant, un cylindre (34) de transport délivrant les cigarettes coupées, un cylindre (43) d'accélération accélérant le transport des cigarettes coupées, et un diffuseur (46) de jets qui propulsent verticalement les cigarettes coupées vers une gaine (10) adjacente au sens de déroulement de la bande et inclinée dans le sens de déroulement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>